'''''Hide-and-Seek''''' is a [[Trailblaze Mission]] in the chapter [[In the Withering Wintry Night]].

==Steps==
# Talk to the unfamiliar woman and find out about what's happening
# Find March 7th and Dan Heng
# See what March 7th is doing
# Find the concealed kid to complete the practice
# Find all the concealed kids to win the game
# Find all the hidden children and win
# Find all the concealed kids to win the game
# Follow Hook to the Fight Club

