===Talk to the unfamiliar woman and find out about what's happening{{subst:void|<!--101040102-->}}===
{{Mission Description|type=trailblaze|location=Natasha's Clinic|As the daughter of the Supreme Guardian, Bronya has always been quick and decisive &mdash; this pursuit operation targeted at you was no exception.<br />Good thing your "good pal" Sampo arrived just in time to rescue you. It's just that... it would've been better if he didn't knock you out with the smoke bomb made from questionable ingredients.<br />In your daze, you realize that you aren't tied up but placed on a bed somewhere &mdash; to a degree, this tells you that you're not in immediate danger. You'll have to ask the unfamiliar woman in front of you for more details.}}
{{Dialogue Start}}

:{{DIcon|Разговор}} ???
:'''???:''' How are you feeling? Any aches or pains?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} No, I feel much better.
::'''???:''' Good. You were out for a while, I was beginning to worry. You were saying some strange things.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} I've got migraines all over my body.
::'''???:''' ...I hope you're joking, hehe... That's either an interesting metaphor, or you hit your head.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} I had a weird dream...
::'''???:''' I bet, you were mumbling something about "Stellarons" and "wishes"... I couldn't make sense of it.
:'''Natasha:''' Well, now that you're awake, you should probably try moving your limbs. I'm Natasha &mdash; a doctor in the underground. You've already spent a day in my clinic.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Nice to meet you, I'm (Trailblazer).
::'''Natasha:''' Nice to meet you too... Hehe, you're very polite.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Is this the underground?
::'''Natasha:''' Yes... it's a place that's been sealed off and neglected by the overgrounders for more than a decade. The underground has none of the splendor of the surface &mdash; the people here dig tunnels and mine ore to make a living.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} This is your clinic?
::'''Natasha:''' Mm-hmm, I'm afraid the conditions underground are terrible. People get sick easily here, and I'm the only doctor.
:'''Natasha:''' Sampo's gone to clear up a mess of his own making, so I'm looking after you in the meantime. Based on your current state, I don't think there's any cause for alarm &mdash; you seem perfectly healthy.
:'''Natasha:''' So if you don't mind, I'll go and take a look at the other patients?
:{{Диалог|Разговор}} Why did I pass out?
::'''Natasha:''' Sampo just told me that you lost consciousness. He didn't say why. Still, I'll wager it had something to do with him &mdash; he's always tinkering with his devices.
::'''Natasha:''' Anyway, the opinion of the clinic is that none of you have come to harm.
:;(Return to previous option selection)
:{{Диалог|Разговор}} People were following us...
::'''Natasha:''' Sampo told me. Don't worry, the Silvermane Guards won't follow you below ground. We've been cut off from the surface for many years. Even when things were at their worst down here, they never showed.
::'''Natasha:''' ...Of course, I don't know the whole story behind why the Architects ordered the lockdown. Who knows, thanks to you, they might finally be about to lift it... something that Wildfire's wanted to achieve for a long time now.
:;(Return to previous option selection)
:{{Диалог|Разговор}} What's our medical bill...
::'''Natasha:''' Oh, please, you needn't worry. You've just been asleep for a while, I barely had to lift a finger.
::'''Natasha:''' I... might've exaggerated your condition for Sampo's ears... but that guy owes me. He better bring me back some medicine.
:;(Return to previous option selection)
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Where are my friends?
::'''Natasha:''' They've been up for a while already. The young guy with the dark hair left first &mdash; he went with Sampo.
::'''Natasha:''' Your rowdier friend took off soon after waking up. I imagine she'll be taking a stroll nearby.
::'''Natasha:''' As for the girl in the Silvermane Guard uniform, I told Sampo to watch her... but it seems that he left his post and she made a run for it.
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Who is this Sampo anyway?
:::'''Natasha:''' Good question... he's a man of mystery. He claims to be a simple cross-border businessman &mdash; not that there's much to interest an Overworlder down here. Either way, he's got a surprising number of connections.
:::'''Natasha:''' I've managed to secure more than a few urgent medical supplies through him, and he's been a big help to Wildfire... In any case, I don't think his intentions are sinister.
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} I need to meet up with them.
:::'''Natasha:''' Sure, but don't push yourself. If you start feeling unwell, come straight back and tell me.
:::'''Natasha:''' ...And if you run into any trouble, you can try asking for Wildfire.
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Wildfire?
::'''Natasha:''' It's a grassroots organization. Think of it as the Silvermane Guards of the underground, but less stone-hearted.
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Thank you, Dr. Natasha.
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} I can't thank you enough. Bye for now.
::'''Natasha:''' No need to thank me. It's a doctor's duty to heal.
{{Dialogue End}}

===Find March 7th and Dan Heng{{subst:void|<!--101040103-->}}===
{{Mission Description|type=trailblaze|location=Natasha's Clinic|update|The doctor named Natasha explained the entire incident to you. You now know two things:<br />One, Dan Heng has been grabbed by Sampo. And two, March 7th abandoned you to go shopping. As for Bronya... Well, you're not too concerned about the well-being of your enemies right now.<br />Whatever the case, you decide to find your two companions first and have a deep conversation about why they left you behind.}}
{{Dialogue Start}}

;(Talk to Natasha)
:'''Natasha:''' Y'know, the underground has been cut off from the surface for years. For you outsiders to descend on us out of nowhere is pretty incredible.
:'''Natasha:''' Everything alright? You feeling okay?
:{{Диалог|Разговор}} I want to ask about the Underworld...
::'''Natasha:''' The Underworld? What do you want to know?
::{{Диалог|Разговор}} Why do people live down here?
:::'''Natasha:''' Because we need Geomarrow. After Belobog's construction, the demand for energy kept increasing. The Eternal Freeze prevented us from expanding outwards, so our only choice was to go down.
:::'''Natasha:''' The people answered the call of the Architects and descended, excavating ore veins and establishing mines. Before we were sealed off, it was an honor to work underground.
:::'''Natasha:''' It was a choice... the pursuit of arduous labor for the survival of our entire civilization.
::;(Return to previous option selection)
::{{Диалог|Разговор}} How is life in the Underworld?
:::'''Natasha:''' ...It's never been good. Conditions are tough both above and below the surface. The Overworld is faced with the Eternal Freeze and Fragmentum corrosion, and the Underworld has to contend with hard labor, suffocating heat, and serious shortages.
:::'''Natasha:''' It's been over a decade since the Silvermane Guards withdrew from the Underworld, and the situation here has only gotten worse. The only contact we have is the exchange of Geomarrow for goods.
:::'''Natasha:''' And what's more... the Fragmentum corrosion has begun to reach us down here, too...
::;(Return to previous option selection)
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} I want to ask something else.
::;(Return to previous option selection)
:{{Диалог|Разговор}} I want to ask about Sampo...
::'''Natasha:''' Ask away, but I'm afraid I don't know a lot about him myself.
::{{Диалог|Разговор}} How did you get to know him?
:::'''Natasha:''' A meticulously choreographed "chance meeting..." Sampo is pretty good at orchestrating unexpected encounters, and he always leaves a lasting impression.
:::'''Natasha:''' According to him, that's the gift of a businessman.
::;(Return to previous option selection)
::{{Диалог|Разговор}} Do you know where he went?
:::'''Natasha:''' Hehe, I hear that question a lot &mdash; seems like he owes everyone something. That's why he never discloses his whereabouts.
:::'''Natasha:''' When people need him, he appears, and when people really need him, he disappears. Sampo's first and second laws of motion.
::;(Return to previous option selection)
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} I want to ask something else.
::;(Return to previous option selection)
:{{Диалог|Разговор}} I want to ask about Wildfire...
::'''Natasha:''' ...I'm a doctor, not an informant! Very well, what's the question?
::{{Диалог|Разговор}} What is Wildfire?
:::'''Natasha:''' Wildfire is a volunteer grassroots organization. Like I said, you can think of it as the Silvermane Guards of the underground.
:::'''Natasha:''' They've taken on the duties of the Guards: Maintain safety and order in the Underworld and compete with Fragmentum corrosion for living space.
::;(Return to previous option selection)
::{{Диалог|Разговор}} How can I find them?
:::'''Natasha:''' Wherever there is hardship and a cry for help, there is Wildfire.
:::'''Natasha:''' ...You can always find them.
::;(Return to previous option selection)
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} I want to ask something else.
::;(Return to previous option selection)
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} I'm fine.
::'''Natasha:''' Okay, take care, and make sure you look after yourself.
:'''(Trailblazer):''' (I gotta find March 7th and Dan Heng... but where should I start?)
:{{tx}}
{{Dialogue End}}

